# No agent attribution

All git commits and PRs are **human-only**. Never add agent attribution.

## Forbidden in commits

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` or any Cursor/agent trailer
- `git commit --trailer` for agent co-authors
- `Signed-off-by` / `Assisted-by` naming agents, bots, or Copilot

Author/committer must remain the human user only.

## Cursor settings

Global `~/.cursor/cli-config.json` must have:

```json
"attribution": {
  "attributeCommitsToAgent": false,
  "attributePRsToAgent": false
}
```

Run `./scripts/setup-cursor-autonomy.sh` after Cursor updates reset this.

## Enforcement

- `verify-cursor-autonomy.sh` checks config and git history
- `verify-stop` hook flags commits with agent `Co-authored-by` trailers

## PRs

Do not enable "attribute PR to agent" in Cursor. PR descriptions must not credit agents as co-authors.
